      "investment_requirement": "€30,000 for startup entrepreneurs; €300,000 for direct commercial investment.",
      "required_funds_and_proof": "Employment contract registered with DREETS or proof of financial investment/business plan.",
      "residency_duration": "4 Years multi-year residence card (*carte de séjour pluriannuelle*).",
      "renewal_rules": "Renewable every 4 years as long as qualifying professional activity continues.",
