      "family_inclusion_rules": "Family simplified procedure (*Passeport Talent - Famille*): spouse and minor children obtain residence cards with automatic unrestricted work authorization.",
      "work_and_study_rights": "Full work rights for the authorized Talent Passport activity; open work rights for spouse.",
      "restrictions_and_exceptions": "Exempt from labor market test (*situation de l'emploi non opposable*).",
