      "translation_attestation_requirements": "Certified translation by sworn translator (*traducteur assermenté*).",
      "application_procedure": "File visa request at French consulate, travel to France, complete online ANEF registration within 3 months, and collect 4-year Passeport Talent card at Prefecture.",
